OCPARTICLE 1
NAME Snowfall
# Steady falling snow -- the expressiveness-test case slice 2/4 flagged as checked analytically only,
# never rendered. Same fields as every other effect in this format: emission shape/rate, lifetime,
# initial velocity/spread, gravity, damping, size and colour over life, blend mode. No new code.
SHAPE box 400 400 15
BLEND alphablend
EMISSION 140 0 700
LIFETIME 7 10
DIRECTION 0 0 -1 10
SPEED 25 40
GRAVITY 0 0 -3
DAMPING 0.4
SIZE 3 4
COLOR start 1 1 1 0.85
COLOR end 1 1 1 0.6
GI on
